## **1. CRITICAL HTML/TECHNICAL FIXES**

### **Priority: URGENT** 
**Issue**: 17 HTML validation errors detected - mismatched closing tags

### **Action Items:**

#### **1.1 Fix Mismatched Closing Tags**
**Location**: Lines 603, 616, 809, 816, 831, 838, 853, 860, 881, 1425

**Problem**: Opening and closing tags don't match (likely `<div>` vs `</span>` issues)

**Step-by-step fix:**
```html
<!-- BEFORE (Example of the issue) -->
<div class="element">
    <span>Content here
</div>  <!-- WRONG: Should be </span> first -->

<!-- AFTER (Correct structure) -->
<div class="element">
    <span>Content here</span>
</div>
```

**Developer Instructions:**
1. Open your homepage template file (likely `page-home.php` or in Elementor)
2. Use W3C HTML Validator: https://validator.w3.org/
3. Upload or paste your HTML
4. Fix each error systematically starting from line 603
5. Ensure every `<div>` has matching `</div>`, every `<span>` has `</span>`
6. Re-validate until 0 errors

